    uprightMeaning: "The Ace of Wands bursts forth like a flame igniting in the darkness, representing a powerful surge of creative energy, inspiration, and the thrilling beginning of a passionate new venture. This is the pure seed of fire — the moment when potential transforms into action and a brilliant idea takes its first breath in the material world. You feel alive, motivated, and ready to channel this fiery gift into something meaningful and lasting. Whether it manifests as a new business venture, creative project, or an unexpected burst of enthusiasm for life itself, the Ace of Wands invites you to seize this spark before it fades. Act now with boldness and conviction, for the universe has placed a torch in your hands and the world awaits the light you are meant to carry forward.",
