    uprightMeaning: "The Two of Wands places you at the threshold between what you have built and what you dream of creating next. Standing atop your castle with the world spread before you, you hold a globe in one hand — a symbol of the vast possibilities awaiting your decision. This card represents the exciting but challenging moment of planning your next bold move, weighing ambition against practical reality, and recognizing that your current achievements are merely the foundation for something far greater. You have outgrown your current boundaries and feel the pull of unexplored horizons. The Two of Wands encourages you to dream bigger, plan strategically, and summon the courage to step beyond the comfort of what is known into the magnificent territory of what could be.",
