    uprightMeaning: "The Ace of Cups overflows with the pure essence of love, compassion, and emotional renewal, offering the gift of a new beginning in matters of the heart and spirit. Like a sacred chalice from which five streams pour — representing the five senses and the fullness of emotional experience — this card signals the start of a profound emotional journey that may manifest as a new relationship, a deepening of self-love, a spiritual awakening, or the reawakening of feelings that had grown numb through hardship or self-protection. Your heart is opening to receive and give love in its most authentic form, and the universe is pouring abundant emotional nourishment into your life. Allow yourself to be vulnerable, to feel deeply without defense, and to trust that the love flowing toward you is genuine and deserving of your wholehearted reception.",
